  "description": "Mobile shell chrome Razor components driven entirely by host-supplied contracts, starting with the Android-inspired Back/Home/Recent system navigation bar. Mobile has no taskbar, so this is a sibling package to Kazo.Os.Taskbar.Blazor rather than a modification of it.",
